Layout decisions on the succession map page: the east-west street
runs the full row, so army and officials name plates go above their
circles over block hatch; elites sits on the cardo so its plate goes
right. The PERISTYLE label fits only south of the octagon (elites
owns the north band) in a 2.6 mm knockout. The page prints complete
on one A4 landscape sheet - no cutting - unlike the tiled palace
board, which stays the kit's only assembly work.
